			"end": 4.463,
			"en": "Our new neighbour",
			"zh": "我们的新邻居"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 6.03,
			"end": 10.687,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 11.98,
			"end": 14.969,
			"en": "Why is Nigel a lucky man?",
			"zh": "为什么奈杰尔是个幸运的人？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 17.19,
			"end": 20.769,
			"en": "Nigel is our new next-door neighbour.",
			"zh": "奈杰尔是我们的新邻居。"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 21.64,
			"end": 23.153,
			"en": "He's a pilot.",
			"zh": "他是一名飞行员。"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 24.16,
			"end": 26.588,
			"en": "He was in the R.A.F.",
			"zh": "他曾服役于皇家空军。"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 28.29,
			"end": 31.429,
			"en": "He will fly to New York next month.",
			"zh": "下个月他将飞往纽约。"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 33.19,
			"end": 37.082,
			"en": "The month after next he'll fly to Tokyo.",
			"zh": "下下个月他将飞往东京。"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 38.62,
			"end": 41.513,
			"en": "At the moment, he's in Madrid.",
			"zh": "此刻，他在马德里。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 42.31,
			"end": 45.089,
			"en": "He flew to Spain a week ago.",
			"zh": "一周前他飞往西班牙。"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 46.58,
			"end": 50.721,
			"en": "He'll return to London the week after next.",
			"zh": "下下周他将返回伦敦。"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 52.15,
			"end": 55.257,
			"en": "He's only forty-one years old,",
			"zh": "他只有四十一岁，"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 55.89,
			"end": 61.942,
			"en": "and he has already been to nearly every country in the world.",
			"zh": "而且他已经去过世界上几乎每一个国家。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 63.42,
			"end": 66.226,
			"en": "Nigel is a very lucky man.",
			"zh": "奈杰尔是一个非常幸运的人。"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 67.2,
			"end": 69.854,
			"en": "But his wife isn't very lucky.",
			"zh": "但是他的妻子却不那么幸运。"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 70.52,
			"end": 73.329,
			"en": "She usually stays at home!",
			"zh": "她通常待在家里！"
